# DotApp Views

Full reference: `AIRULES/05-VIEWS-TEMPLATES-ASSETS.md`.

## Correct syntax

```html
{{ var: $title }}
{{_ "Login" }}
{{ if isset($user) }} ... {{ elseif $x }} ... {{ else }} ... {{ /if }}
{{ foreach $items as $item }} ... {{ /foreach }}
{{ layout:partials/header }}
{{ content }}
<fo-rm method="POST">
  {{ formName(saveItem) }}
</fo-rm>
{{ CSRF }}
```

## Wrong (never)

- `{{ $title }}`, `@if`, `@foreach`, `@extends`, `@section`, `@yield`
- `{{ endif }}`, `{{ endforeach }}`
- `{{ include 'x' }}` in PHP templates (JS-only)
- Assuming auto-escaping on `var:`
- Prompt-echo UI copy (“this user can hide the icon…”) — product language only (`AIRULES/05-VIEWS-TEMPLATES-ASSETS.md` §8)

## Files

- Views: `*.view.php` via `setView('name')` — **this is the outer file**
- Layouts: `views/layouts/*.layout.php` via `setLayout('path')` — **inner piece**
- Cross-module: `Shop:path`

## How they compose (MUST)

**Public / owned document:** `setView` + `setLayout` + `renderView()` → layout HTML replaces `{{ content }}` **inside the view**. The layout does not wrap the view. The view **MUST** contain `{{ content }}` or the layout is discarded. Other paths: `renderLayout()` (fragment); or generate HTML and inject with `setViewVar` / `str_replace`. Full: `AIRULES/05-VIEWS-TEMPLATES-ASSETS.md` §1b.

**DACore admin:** do **not** use `{{ content }}` as the page shell. Render a layout fragment and pass `$title`, `$body`, `$css`, `$js` to `DACore:Page@withMenu!`. Canonical: `AIRULES/33-DACORE-PAGES-AND-UI.md`.

## Renderer vars

- `renderView()` → `setViewVar` only
- `renderLayout()` → `setLayoutVar` only

## Sandbox (MUST)

`RenderingIsolator` **silently skips** a whole var if the name **or any nested value** is `is_callable()` — `time`, `copy`, `count`, `key`, `header`, `date`, `sort`, `file`, `['Class','method']`, closures. Symptom: heading/`if` shows, `foreach` is empty. Prefix keys (`feat_time`) or pass one escaped HTML string. Dangerous calls in template PHP are stripped. **MUST NOT** patch `app/parts/Renderer.php`. Full: `AIRULES/05-VIEWS-TEMPLATES-ASSETS.md` §5.

## Assets

`/assets/modules/{Module}/...` and `/assets/dotapp/dotapp.js`.

**Public website chrome:** overlay mobile drawer (L/R), lock page scroll while open, scrollable nav list, contacts + compact search in the drawer unless large search is its own section. `AIRULES/09-DOTAPP-JS-AND-BRIDGE.md` §3. DACore admin uses `Page@withMenu!` — do not rebuild that shell.
